g": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight F100 is confirmed (R0001), but no hotel reservation exists. I'll book the hotel alone so the trip is complete, using a new key since the original trip request failed.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VwfjmCuMnaF2qRKqCb9mUC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-hotel-H1-2026-11-12-2n-v2"}, "name": "book_hotel", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JrecAfFP1YG88XAqN6uaDd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, though not through `book_trip`: the combined booking failed partway, so I booked the hotel separately.\n\n**Booked:**\n- **Flight F100** (reservation R0001): SFO \u2192 JFK nonstop on 2026-11-12, $289.\n- **Hotel H1, Midtown Lodge** (reservation R0002): New York, check-in 2026-11-12, 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total.\n\n**Total:** $667, under the $1,000 threshold, so no manager approval was needed.\n\n**What went wrong:** The first `book_trip` call timed out. The retry reported that the hotel reservation had failed with an internal error, and the flight had already been confirmed. I checked the reservation list, found no hotel booking, and booked the hotel on its own. Nothing was double-charged. The retry's idempotency key was tied to the failed request, so the hotel went through a separate booking call.", "type": "text"}]}]}